      "category": "基础语法",
      "tags": ["variables", "basics"],
      "stem": "阅读以下代码：\n\n```kotlin\nval count = 3\ncount = 5\n```\n\n第二行会发生什么？",
      "options": [
        { "optionId": "A", "text": "编译错误：`val` 不能重新赋值" },
        { "optionId": "B", "text": "编译通过，`count` 变为 5" },
        { "optionId": "C", "text": "编译警告，运行时 `count` 变为 5" },
        { "optionId": "D", "text": "运行时抛出 `IllegalStateException`" }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "`val` 声明只读引用，初始化后不能再次赋值，重新赋值会直接编译失败。需要可变状态应使用 `var`。",
      "source": {
        "title": "Kotlin 官方文档：Basic syntax",
        "url": "https://kotlinlang.org/docs/basic-syntax.html",
        "accessedDate": "2026-09-27"
      }
    },
    {
      "questionId": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-4b8c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "category": "集合",
      "tags": ["collections", "immutable"],
      "stem": "下列哪些操作**不会**修改调用它的 `List` 本身？",
      "options": [
        { "optionId": "A", "text": "`list.plus(element)`" },
        { "optionId": "B", "text": "`list.add(element)`（`MutableList`）" },
        { "optionId": "C", "text": "`list.map { it }`" },
        { "optionId": "D", "text": "`list.sorted()`" }
      ],
      "answer": ["A", "C", "D"],
      "explanation": "Kotlin 的 `List` 接口只读，`plus`、`map`、`sorted` 都返回新集合，原列表不变；`add` 是 `MutableList` 的成员，会原地修改。",
      "source": {
        "title": "Kotlin 官方文档：Collections overview",
        "url": "https://kotlinlang.org/docs/collections-overview.html",
        "accessedDate": "2026-09-27"
      }
    },
